{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e874abbf-ede4-8bc6-95fb-3a8479b591e2",
  "created_at": "2026-01-02T15:47:14-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Maureen Kearney",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:44:39-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. Happy New Year, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:44:44-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, happy New Year. Um, I'm calling about a puddle, well, it's a big puddle, it's across like half the road, and it won't go away. Is this the right place for that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:44:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is, yes. Where's the puddle, hon?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:44:58-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's one thirty-one Malbone Road, in the North End. Right out front, kind of by the curb and then out into the street. It's been there, I don't know, it hasn't even rained since before the holidays. So it's not from rain. Is that okay, that you can still look at it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:45:15-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, we can. So one thirty-one Malbone Road, standing water across about half the road, and no rain in a while. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:45:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, exactly, half the road. And it's just sitting there, it doesn't go down, it doesn't dry up. [line breaks up] it's so cold now I'm worried it's going to be ice, you know, ice on top of it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:45:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up on me a little. You said it might freeze?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:45:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, freeze. And there's an older man next door, my neighbor, he can't really get out, he's got a walker, and he can't step around that. So he's kind of stuck in the house. Is that okay to say? Like, does that make it more, I mean can you move it up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:45:59-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, I'll put that in the notes. Does the water seem to be coming from anywhere, like a drain nearby or a pipe?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:46:07-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "There's a drain right there, I think, but it's not taking anything. Um, can I ask, is that a city drain or a state one? Because I wasn't sure who to even call. My friend said you guys are really good, that this office actually gets back to people, so I called here first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:46:24-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's nice to hear. Malbone Road, I believe, is a city street, but I'll have the crew confirm who owns that drain. If it's the state's, we'll pass it along to them ourselves so you don't have to chase it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:46:37-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay, good, that's good. Because it's just, it keeps sitting there and nobody has come, and I've been looking at it for like a week. I just want somebody to look at it. Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:46:49-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's fine. Can I get a number in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:46:55-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:46:58-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-nine-three, and it's Maureen?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:47:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, Maureen Kearney. Thank you, thank you. So somebody will come look, right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:47:06-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sending it over today, with the note about your neighbor. Have a good weekend, Maureen."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-02T15:47:12-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too, thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
